jobs.description:
Our client is a leading European B2B distributor operating across multiple European markets, with a broad multi-brand portfolio and an extensive product catalogue.

The company is undergoing a major digital transformation to become a more digital-first B2B organisation. The program will replace its existing B2B web platform with a modern e-commerce architecture connecting key business systems including ERP, PIM, CRM, DAM and WMS.

Jobomschrijving

As Freelance Program Director, you will :

• Lead the overall B2B e-commerce transformation program ;
• Own program governance, roadmap, budget, risks and dependencies ;
• Coordinate business, IT and external implementation partners ;
• Drive delivery across multiple European markets and storefronts ;
• Ensure alignment between e-commerce, ERP, PIM, CRM, DAM and WMS ;
• Manage senior stakeholders and provide clear program reporting ;
• Drive decision-making, issue resolution and program priorities ;
• Ensure successful delivery, adoption and transition into operations ;

A successful Freelance Program Director should have:

• 10-15 years of relevant program/project management experience ;
• Strong track record in B2B e-commerce, webshops or digital transformation ;
• Experience managing complex, multi-country programs ;
• Strong stakeholder and external partner management skills :
• Experience with e-commerce platforms; Shopify/Magento is a must ;
• Good understanding of ERP, PIM, CRM and integration environments :
• Structured, pragmatic and highly delivery-oriented :
• Fluent in French and English :

A leading international pharmaceutical organisation in Berchem is looking for an Accountant to join their team. This full-time role offers the perfect mix of responsibility, variety, and professional growth within a supportive and international environment. With flexible working hours, attractive benefits, and a collaborative culture, this is your chance to make a real impact.

Your responsibilities as Accountant:

• A-Z responsibility of various VAT (BE + Other EU) declarations on monthly and quarterly basis;
• Assist the team in the daily operational accounting tasks (financial journals, purchase invoices,…);
• Back-up of other accountants;
• Cashflow-management (prepare foreign currency exchanges, ICO-payments, …)
• Preparing vendor payments in Isabel;
• Controlling and administrating the expense note application;
• Handling of the general finance mailbox
• Preparing and recording monthly accruals and deferrals;
• Assist in month-end and year-end closing;
• Assist in ad hoc projects to optimize current processes;
• The accounting team currently consists of 2 accountants.

Your profile as Accountant:

• Bachelor in Accountancy 
• First years of experience in similar roles
• Good knowledge of BE VAT
• Proficient in MS office
• Knowledge of MS AX and MS D365 is a plus
• Fluent in Dutch and English
• You are accurate and detail-oriented
• Proactive, stress-resistant, and eager to learn with strong analytical skills.
